---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
---
<Base title="About Nyamira Daily">
  <PageHead title="About Nyamira Daily" lead="An independent, non-partisan information service about Nyamira County." />
  <div class="stack" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:720px">
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <p>We explain how Nyamira County is run and what it delivers, in plain language: how much money the county receives and spends, what services exist in each ward, who our leaders are, and what the Constitution and county laws say.</p>
    <h2>What we are not</h2>
    <p>We are not a news site and we do not campaign for any party or candidate. We report what public records and on-the-ground checks show, including what works well.</p>
    <h2>How we keep it honest</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every figure links to its source, usually an official report.</li>
      <li>Every claim carries a label: Verified, Audit finding, Official claim or Unverified.</li>
      <li>When an allegation is cleared or a case is dropped, we say so as clearly as we reported the allegation.</li>
      <li>We correct mistakes openly. See <a href="/how-we-work/#corrections">corrections</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Using our data</h2>
    <p>Our tables are free to reuse with credit to Nyamira Daily. <a href="/data/open-data/">Download the data</a>.</p>
    <div class="sw" lang="sw">
      <span class="eyebrow">Muhtasari kwa Kiswahili</span>
      <p>Nyamira Daily ni huduma huru ya habari kuhusu kaunti ya Nyamira. Haiungi mkono chama wala mgombea yeyote. Kila takwimu ina chanzo, na tunasahihisha makosa waziwazi.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
